  "description": "Lowe’s is sliding, recession signals are showing up, and this proves why we would rather buy stocks showing strength.",
  "body_html": "<p>Thinking about remodeling your home? You are not alone. </p><p>With stagnant wages<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> and credit card delinquencies more than double their 2021 levels<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\">2</a> many people will skip the elaborate and costly vacation; and instead improve their immediate living spaces. This is a classic pre-recession indicator that has been well documented through several market cycles. Check out the video where I explain more. </p><p>But this brought up Lowe’s, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$LOW&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>, and whether or not this stock is a buy. My speculation, is that we will see a reversal with Lowe’s…however it is NOT a stock to buy right now. At this present moment, Lowe’s is hitting 52 day lows and 52 week lows…trend is NOT friend. </p><p>A commentor, stated: “When Stocks are hitting 52 week lows, that is when you buy!”</p><h4>WRONG ❌</h4><p>Some popular names hitting 52 week highs and 52 week lows<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-3\" href=\"#footnote-3\" target=\"_self\">3</a> </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r-Cp!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bf53e71-5e38-44e4-9efe-8eacc9cfc2df_374x206.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r-Cp!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bf53e71-5e38-44e4-9efe-8eacc9cfc2df_374x206.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r-Cp!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bf53e71-5e38-44e4-9efe-8eacc9cfc2df_374x206.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r-Cp!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bf53e71-5e38-44e4-9efe-8eacc9cfc2df_374x206.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r-Cp!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bf53e71-5e38-44e4-9efe-8eacc9cfc2df_374x206.png\" width=\"374\" height=\"206\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9bf53e71-5e38-44e4-9efe-8eacc9cfc2df_374x206.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:206,&quot;width&quot;:374,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:14114,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/216728145?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bf53e71-5e38-44e4-9efe-8eacc9cfc2df_374x206.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r-Cp!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bf53e71-5e38-44e4-9efe-8eacc9cfc2df_374x206.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r-Cp!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bf53e71-5e38-44e4-9efe-8eacc9cfc2df_374x206.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r-Cp!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bf53e71-5e38-44e4-9efe-8eacc9cfc2df_374x206.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r-Cp!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bf53e71-5e38-44e4-9efe-8eacc9cfc2df_374x206.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Easier to get into a winning position buying highs…</figcaption></figure></div><p>Imagine, buying a low, only for it to hit 7 more lows, making for a miserable 1,748 days. However, buying a high like Berkshire, which has hit 5, 52 day highs (major breakthroughs), you have 1440 days to get into a winning position. Way better strategy!                           </p><h4>This is a hill I will die on: </h4><p><strong>Buy highs. Don’t buy dips. Don’t dollar cost average. </strong></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div><hr></div><p>The stock market closed up and green on Friday, which often indicates a bullish Monday and Tuesday, and we are in fact seeing the majority of stocks moving up pre-market today. The VIX continues to trend lower. So at this moment, there is nothing “alarming.”</p><p>My primary focus remains on silver and “recession resistant” assets. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-market-reversed-here-are-my-3?r=4z8lgl\">Three stocks I am targeting and entry points (click here)</a></strong> remain relevant. Interest rates temporarily shook the market, however we have not seen any structural breaks. </p><p>If you have any questions or just want to talk, feel free to swing by the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/01f94563-c285-45fe-bbbb-a6f64b16e1c5\">Main Chat</a>. That is where I, and several other great investors hang out during market hours. </p><h4>Be sure to like ❤️ and re-stack 🔄 this post to fight the AI slop </h4><p>Thanks for stopping by! </p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stop-buying-stocks-at-52-week-lows?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone that likes to buy dips? Send this post to them. </p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stop-buying-stocks-at-52-week-lows?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stop-buying-stocks-at-52-week-lows?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2018/08/07/for-most-us-workers-real-wages-have-barely-budged-for-decades/</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-2\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-2\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">2</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/DRCCLACBS</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-3\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-3\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">3</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.wsj.com/market-data/stocks/newfiftytwoweekhighsandlows</p></div></div>",
